<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">raise-golem</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Raise Golem</ansi> spell reshapes a corpse into a massive, lumbering
construct of flesh and bone that obliterates all in its path. Golems are
the ultimate expressions of necromantic power — brutal, unstoppable, and
requiring the remains of truly magnificent creatures to sustain.

Golems are colossal melee combatants that crush foes with overwhelming
physical force. They move with the weight of small mountains, shaking the
earth beneath their feet.

The undead servant's power scales with your willpower and spellcasting skill.
More skilled casters raise more formidable specimens.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast raise-golem [corpse]</ansi>     Animate nearby remains.

<ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">14</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">Corpse:      </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">Requires overwhelming remains</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">Target:      </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">Nearby corpse or ground loot</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">100</ansi>
<ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> <ansi fg="white-bold">Manifestation</ansi>

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - The golem appears under your command and aids you in combat.
  - Once raised, the undead servant remains active as a companion.
  - Use the <ansi fg="command">assess</ansi> command to evaluate a corpse's quality.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help manifestation</ansi>,
  <ansi fg="command">help assess</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help companion</ansi>
